{"root":"gandeng","ipa":"/ɡan.dəŋ/","core":"牵手，连接，挂钩","pos":["动词","形容词"],"scenes":["高频","生活"],"rootBlock":{"ipa":"/ɡan.dəŋ/","zh":"牵手，连接，挂钩","phrases":[{"t":"gandeng tangan","zh":"牵手"},{"t":"bergandeng tangan","zh":"手拉手"},{"t":"gandeng mesra","zh":"亲密地牵手"}],"examples":[{"t":"Mereka berjalan sambil gandeng tangan.","zh":"他们边走边牵手。"},{"t":"Truk itu menggandeng sebuah kereta gandeng.","zh":"那辆卡车拖着一辆挂车。"}]},"ders":[{"w":"gandeng","ipa":"/ɡan.dəŋ/","zh":"牵，连","phrase":{"t":"gandeng tangan","zh":"牵手"},"example":{"t":"Dia gandeng adiknya menyeberang jalan.","zh":"他牵着弟弟过马路。"}},{"w":"bergandeng","ipa":"/bər.ɡan.dəŋ/","zh":"连在一起，手拉手","phrase":{"t":"bergandeng tangan","zh":"手拉手"},"example":{"t":"Kita harus bergandeng tangan menghadapi masalah ini.","zh":"我们必须携手面对这个问题。"}},{"w":"bergandengan","ipa":"/bər.ɡan.də.ŋan/","zh":"互相牵手，并排连接","phrase":{"t":"bergandengan tangan","zh":"手牵手地"},"example":{"t":"Pasangan itu berjalan bergandengan di taman.","zh":"那对情侣在公园里手牵手散步。"}},{"w":"menggandeng","ipa":"/məŋ.ɡan.dəŋ/","zh":"牵，拉，勾结，拉拢","phrase":{"t":"menggandeng mitra","zh":"拉拢合作伙伴"},"example":{"t":"Perusahaan itu menggandeng investor asing.","zh":"那家公司拉拢了外国投资者。"}},{"w":"menggandengkan","ipa":"/məŋ.ɡan.dəŋ.kan/","zh":"使连接，使挂钩","phrase":{"t":"menggandengkan gerbong","zh":"连接车厢"},"example":{"t":"Petugas sedang menggandengkan gerbong kereta api.","zh":"工作人员正在连接火车车厢。"}},{"w":"gandengan","ipa":"/ɡan.də.ŋan/","zh":"挂钩，连接物，伴侣，挂车","phrase":{"t":"mobil gandengan","zh":"挂车"},"example":{"t":"Mana gandenganmu malam ini?","zh":"你今晚的伴侣在哪？"}},{"w":"tergandeng","ipa":"/tər.ɡan.dəŋ/","zh":"被连接的，已挂上的","phrase":{"t":"sudah tergandeng","zh":"已经连上了"},"example":{"t":"Gerbong itu sudah tergandeng dengan lokomotif.","zh":"那节车厢已经和机头连上了。"}}],"derSlugs":["gandeng","bergandeng","bergandengan","menggandeng","menggandengkan","gandengan","tergandeng"],"model":"gemini-3-flash-preview","createdAt":"2026-09-26T17:52:58.895Z","src":"base"}